    "DefaultText": "The Apothecary keeps the coin her salves and teas have earned in this banded chest, along with a few specimens too good to sell across a market stall. She adds to it most weeks, though a herbalist's takings are never large. Drag a valuable item onto the chest to sell it to her - she can only pay what is actually inside. There is nothing stopping you searching it yourself, either, if you are willing to risk being caught."
  },
